Description: removes music from your computer's audio
 Sukut filters what your computer plays and removes the music, while
 keeping speech and other sounds. Everything is processed locally.
 .
 It offers three modes (Music Filter, Optimized and Strict), works on all
 system audio or one app through its own PipeWire output, rests while
 nothing is playing, and stays in the tray. It can also install and
 activate Sukut on an Android phone over USB.
